# Elephant Gym evidence must be byte-exact.
#
# Run receipts attest every artifact by sha256, and tools/registry.mjs re-hashes those
# files to detect silent mutation. With core.autocrlf=true, git rewrites LF to CRLF on
# checkout — which would change every hash and make a faithful checkout report 88
# artifacts as tampered. `-text` disables conversion entirely, so the bytes git stores
# are the bytes a receipt attests, on every machine and every clone.
runs/** -text

# Receipts and declarations are machine-read JSON; the same reasoning applies.
runs/receipts/** -text